{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a robot sent to a planet to set up a system to make it habitable for your creators:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design factories run by drones. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create bases to craft and shelter in. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your abilities and terraform to expand the area you can explore. You have both a health and charge meter that can get heavily upgraded over time.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up systems to monitor storms and deploy resources to protect buildings in their path. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build out a skybase that houses a data center and launches rockets. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and grow various plants and stabilize the climate to make the planet habitable. Watch as the visibility increases to reveal your creation and the planet transforms dramatically from a barren to lush environment.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build factories automated entirely by drones!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305210/extras/7953ddd5f71dfb6e6d1b6ba5de273edc.poster.avif?t=1771628658\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305210/extras/7953ddd5f71dfb6e6d1b6ba5de273edc.webm?t=1771628658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305210/extras/7953ddd5f71dfb6e6d1b6ba5de273edc.mp4?t=1771628658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create systems to mine and process materials in automated pipelines. Configure drones to easily handle the logistics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skyformer\u2019s automation is different from that of similar games. Resource deposits provide an infinite supply of resources, but as you get further into the game it challenges and rewards you for utilizing the production rates that you have and the entire map the best that you can. At the same time, it keeps calculations straightforward with simple ratios and round numbers. There are also quality of life features that make it easy to understand what's going on; you can come back to old saves and quickly pick up where you left off.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Terraform and track the weather!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305210/extras/c58d6a86159c92c31d7c92047ec0683e.poster.avif?t=1771628658\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305210/extras/c58d6a86159c92c31d7c92047ec0683e.webm?t=1771628658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305210/extras/c58d6a86159c92c31d7c92047ec0683e.mp4?t=1771628658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The processed materials allow you to create and run a system that controls the climate, tracks the weather, and terraforms the planet. As you terraform, the planet becomes more capable of producing weather systems, some of which being quite destructive. This game has a dynamic weather system that interacts with the geography, producing microclimates in each region based on the current global climate. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the process and achieve habitability!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305210/extras/5b3ee52b9ca7a5492675a80f6bde9d0f.poster.avif?t=1771628658\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305210/extras/5b3ee52b9ca7a5492675a80f6bde9d0f.webm?t=1771628658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305210/extras/5b3ee52b9ca7a5492675a80f6bde9d0f.mp4?t=1771628658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Changing the climate of the planet can allow access to previously inhospitable regions, but can also do the opposite. Observing the weather and how the geography influences it is important to surviving the terraforming process. A blend of strategies can be used to survive storms, such as building up an expansive automated drone defense system, strategically positioning buildings, or simply maximizing the power of your tools and taking storms head-on. The energy produced by the storms can also be harnessed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal of the game is to achieve a climate that maximizes biomass across each region, and stabilize the atmosphere to the point at which storms are no longer destructive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skyformer is a debut game made with passion with both the game engine and all the art handmade by one developer over several years. It's being worked on intensely to 1.0 in 2026! <br><br>Music and sound by Marty Meinerz.\u00a0</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Weather Map","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2305210/5075dbfd9c42ceff0476502cd54eb5a4eadc0ac8.jpg"},{"name":"Expanding Out","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2305210/fdf50753fbf2ef61ad056e3b5f5cbbbb305acd4c.jpg"},{"name":"Drone Defense","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2305210/f61f2d415bce184adcf3737d58570a999b54d6ad.jpg"},{"name":"Climate Changer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2305210/d3095726277bcfa7887fd575613e86ddf9c258d5.jpg"},{"name":"Rockets!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2305210/b18eb1b061f86b70a6f0d682e68f2fe4d495e328.jpg"},{"name":"The Data Center","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2305210/e0195e81f662744dc3cf139fa56422c1bcb5ab38.jpg"},{"name":"Planes!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2305210/70f651404a41479a4c3bcec10a948852aa9f09f9.jpg"},{"name":"Ancient Mysteries","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2305210/5a57d0d5640bab55acd795897ee44e73d14183a8.jpg"},{"name":"New Biomes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2305210/620aee1a7f9cc0f4a594d1d139341f9510d6429e.jpg"},{"name":"Ice Melter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2305210/69b8c31c178c5a13acb9f542ae5c16f0cbe0628d.jpg"}],"total":18},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2305210?t=1771628658","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305210/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771628658","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305210/8931f102c00f110b980c2c2ecd66fdebbe7b2ecb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771628658","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305210/8931f102c00f110b980c2c2ecd66fdebbe7b2ecb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771628658","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3750530,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a robot sent to a planet to set up a system to make it habitable for your creators:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design factories run by drones. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create bases to craft and shelter in. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your abilities and terraform to expand the area you can explore. You have both a health and charge meter that can get heavily upgraded over time.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up systems to monitor storms and deploy resources to protect buildings in their path. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build out a skybase that houses a data center and launches rockets. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and grow various plants and stabilize the climate to make the planet habitable. Watch as the visibility increases to reveal your creation and the planet transforms dramatically from a barren to lush environment.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build factories automated entirely by drones!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305210/extras/7953ddd5f71dfb6e6d1b6ba5de273edc.poster.avif?t=1771628658\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305210/extras/7953ddd5f71dfb6e6d1b6ba5de273edc.webm?t=1771628658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305210/extras/7953ddd5f71dfb6e6d1b6ba5de273edc.mp4?t=1771628658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create systems to mine and process materials in automated pipelines. Configure drones to easily handle the logistics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skyformer\u2019s automation is different from that of similar games. Resource deposits provide an infinite supply of resources, but as you get further into the game it challenges and rewards you for utilizing the production rates that you have and the entire map the best that you can. At the same time, it keeps calculations straightforward with simple ratios and round numbers. There are also quality of life features that make it easy to understand what's going on; you can come back to old saves and quickly pick up where you left off.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Terraform and track the weather!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305210/extras/c58d6a86159c92c31d7c92047ec0683e.poster.avif?t=1771628658\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305210/extras/c58d6a86159c92c31d7c92047ec0683e.webm?t=1771628658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305210/extras/c58d6a86159c92c31d7c92047ec0683e.mp4?t=1771628658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The processed materials allow you to create and run a system that controls the climate, tracks the weather, and terraforms the planet. As you terraform, the planet becomes more capable of producing weather systems, some of which being quite destructive. This game has a dynamic weather system that interacts with the geography, producing microclimates in each region based on the current global climate. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the process and achieve habitability!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305210/extras/5b3ee52b9ca7a5492675a80f6bde9d0f.poster.avif?t=1771628658\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305210/extras/5b3ee52b9ca7a5492675a80f6bde9d0f.webm?t=1771628658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305210/extras/5b3ee52b9ca7a5492675a80f6bde9d0f.mp4?t=1771628658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Changing the climate of the planet can allow access to previously inhospitable regions, but can also do the opposite. Observing the weather and how the geography influences it is important to surviving the terraforming process. A blend of strategies can be used to survive storms, such as building up an expansive automated drone defense system, strategically positioning buildings, or simply maximizing the power of your tools and taking storms head-on. The energy produced by the storms can also be harnessed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal of the game is to achieve a climate that maximizes biomass across each region, and stabilize the atmosphere to the point at which storms are no longer destructive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skyformer is a debut game made with passion with both the game engine and all the art handmade by one developer over several years. It's being worked on intensely to 1.0 in 2026! <br><br>Music and sound by Marty Meinerz.\u00a0</p>","developers":["Weatherfused"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305210/ccd76650c45433b50c0f8779bf41b0897d36173c/header.jpg?t=1771628658","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<st